  "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><table style=\"margin: 0 0 0.5em 1em; border:1px solid silver; float:right; font-size:90%; text-align:left;\" cellpadding=\"5\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"font-size:110%; text-align:center; background-color:#ACD\">Gain Sousuke\n</th></tr>\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quest#Section\" title=\"Quest\">Section</a>\n</th>\n<td>Realm of Torment Quests\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD\"><a href=\"/wiki/Campaign\" title=\"Campaign\">Campaign</a>\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Nightfall\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nightfall\">Nightfall</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Given by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte_Sousuke\" title=\"Acolyte Sousuke\">Acolyte Sousuke</a> <br />in <a href=\"/wiki/Throne_of_Secrets\" title=\"Throne of Secrets\">Throne of Secrets</a> <br />(<a href=\"/wiki/Realm_of_Torment\" title=\"Realm of Torment\">Realm of Torment</a>)\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Preceded by\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Abaddon%27s_Gate\" title=\"Abaddon&#39;s Gate\">Abaddon's Gate</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr valign=\"top\">\n<th style=\"background-color:#ACD;\">Type\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Secondary_quest\" title=\"Secondary quest\">Secondary quest</a>\n</td></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p>This is one of the quests that allows access to all of the heroes at the end of Nightfall.  \n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Quest_information\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quest information</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Requirements\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Requirements</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Objectives\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Objectives</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Reward\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reward</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Walkthrough\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Walkthrough</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Initial_dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Initial dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Reward_dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Reward dialogue</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quest_information\">Quest information</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Sousuke&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Quest information\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Requirements\">Requirements</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Sousuke&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Requirements\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Must not have Acolyte Sousuke as one of your <a href=\"/wiki/Hero\" title=\"Hero\">heroes</a>.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Objectives\">Objectives</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Sousuke&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Objectives\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Speak with <a href=\"/wiki/Field_General_Hayao\" title=\"Field General Hayao\">General Hayao</a> and formally accept Sousuke's oath of fealty.</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward\">Reward</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Sousuke&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Reward\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>2,500 <a href=\"/wiki/Experience\" title=\"Experience\">Experience</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Acolyte_Sousuke\" title=\"Acolyte Sousuke\">Acolyte Sousuke</a> joins your party.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Walkthrough\">Walkthrough</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Sousuke&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Walkthrough\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Exit the <a href=\"/wiki/Throne_of_Secrets\" title=\"Throne of Secrets\">Throne of Secrets</a> and return to <a href=\"/wiki/Kamadan,_Jewel_of_Istan\" title=\"Kamadan, Jewel of Istan\">Kamadan, Jewel of Istan</a>.  Then exit into the <a href=\"/wiki/Sun_Docks\" title=\"Sun Docks\">Sun Docks</a> and speak to Field General Hayao to complete the quest.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Sousuke&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Initial_dialogue\">Initial dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Sousuke&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Initial dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><b>Acolyte Sousuke</b>\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>\"You're the one I've been searching for!  I'm glad I found you.  General Hayao wanted news of your travels to carry back to <a href=\"/wiki/Cantha\" title=\"Cantha\">Cantha</a>.  I volunteered for the job!  I know you've been through a lot, but I think I can help you in the future.  While you're making your report, do you mind asking <b>General Hayao</b> if I can join your service?  I know he'd let me if you asked personally.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<dl><dd><dl><dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tick_green.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Yes\"><img alt=\"Yes\" src=\"/images/5/52/Tick_green.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Accept:</b> <i>\"You seem a useful fellow.\"</i></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Icon_No_ingame.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"No\"><img alt=\"No\" src=\"/images/0/09/Icon_No_ingame.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Decline:</b> <i>\"I've already got so many friends it feels like I'm herding cats.\"</i></dd>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tango-question-mark.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"Ask\"><img alt=\"Ask\" src=\"/images/a/ab/Tango-question-mark.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" data-file-width=\"20\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></a>&#160;<b>Ask:</b> <i>\"Did you ask <b>General Hayao</b>?  Did he say yes?  I'm so nervous!\"</i></dd></dl></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Reward_dialogue\">Reward dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=Gain_Sousuke&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Reward dialogue\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><b>Field General Hayao</b>\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>\"Sousuke?  He is a fine <a href=\"/wiki/Elementalist\" title=\"Elementalist\">Elementalist</a>...and a better friend.  I'm certain he will make a good companion.  Just be sure to tell him where to point those fireballs...he can get a little overexcited.  Good luck.\"</i></dd></dl>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261009132059\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 343/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3241/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1003/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   24.223      1 -total\n 50.15%   12.148      1 Template:Quest_infobox\n 49.25%   11.930      1 Template:Offer_dialog\n 14.78%    3.581      1 Template:Infobox_campaign_row\n 12.71%    3.078      1 Template:Infobox_requirements_row\n 12.41%    3.005      1 Template:Ask\n 11.62%    2.815      1 Template:No\n 11.35%    2.749      1 Template:Yes\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key en_wiki:pcache:idhash:14732-0!canonical and timestamp 20261009132059 and revision id 1845606.\n -->\n</div>"
